<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Please refer enclosed pdf of financial results.  nClarification for Cash Flow Indirect:  n1.In the statement of consolidated unaudited financial results for the quarter and six months ended September  30, 2020 filed with stock exchanges ( Statement),  Share of Net Profit of a Joint Venture Accounted for using the Equity Method  has been shown as line item after  Profit before Share of Profit of a Joint Venture, Exceptional Items and Tax from Continuing Operations . Whereas Profit before tax considered here in the  Cash Flow Indirect  is before the  Share of Net profit of a Joint Venture Accounted for using the Equity Method . Hence, Profit before tax of Rs. 1089.83 crore given here is not matching with Profit before Tax of Rs. 1122.72 Crore. In view of above,  Adjustments for share of Profit of a Joint Venture of Rs. 32.89 Crore given in Consolidated statement of cash flows for the six months ended filed with Stock Exchange is not shown here.  n2. Adjustments for Decrease/ (Increase) in Other Assets of Rs. 1.13 Crore in Statement is bifurcated here into Adjustments for decrease (increase) in other current assets of Rs. (4.42) Crore and Adjustments for decrease (increase) in other non-current assets of Rs. 5.55 Crore.  n3. Adjustments for Decrease/(increase) in Other Financial Assets of Rs.39.57 Crore in Statement is bifurcated into Adjustments for other financial assets, non-current of Rs. 0.06 Crore and Adjustments for other financial assets, current of Rs. 39.51 Crore.  n4. Adjustments for Increase/ (Decrease) in Trade Payables, Other Liabilities and Provisions of Rs. 838.21 in Statement is bifurcated into Adjustments for (increase) decrease in trade payables, current of Rs. 859.57 Crore,Adjustments for (increase) decrease in other current liabilities of Rs. (29.78) Crore, Adjustments for (increase) decrease in other non-current liabilities of Rs. 0.44 Crore, Adjustments for provisions, current of Rs. (0.12) Crore, Adjustments for provisions, non current of Rs. 1.49 Crore and Adjustments for other financial liabilities, current of Rs. 6.61 Crore.  n5. Other adjustments for which cash effects are investing or financing cash flow of Rs. (2.11) crore is the sum of (Gain) from sale of Current Investments of Rs. (0.68) Crore, Realised Foreign Exchange Variation (Gain)/Loss of Rs. (46.05) Crore, Effective portion of Exchange Difference Loss on Hedging Instruments re-clasified to Profit or Loss of Rs. 40.06 Crore and Loss on Disposal of Property, Plant and Equipment (Net) of Rs. 4.56 Crore.  n6.Other adjustments for non-cash items of Rs. 88.26 Crore is the sum of Allowance for Doubtful Debts and Advances (Net) of Rs. 25.11 Crore, Liabilities no Longer Required written back of Rs. (0.52) Crore, Catalyst Charges written off of Rs. 3.72 Crore and Mark to Market Loss/(Gain) on Derivative Transactions of Rs. 59.95 Crore.  n7.Purchase of Property, Plant and Equipment &amp; Intangible Assets in Statement is bifurcated here Purchase of Property, plant and equipment of Rs. 146.94 Crore and Purchase of Intangible assets under development of Rs. 0.22 Crore.  n8.Other Inflows/(Outflows) of cash of Rs. (0.08) Crore is the sum of Proceeds from sale of Current Investments of Rs. 0.68 Crore and Fixed Deposits placed (having original maturity of more than three months) of Rs. (0.76) Crore.  n9. Proceeds from exercise of stock options represents Receipt of amount from CFCL Employees Welfare Trust of Rs. 1.40 Crore.  n10.Proceeds from Borrowings includes Availment of Buyer's Credit/Supplier's Credit.  n11. Repayment of Borrowings of Rs. 4283.35 Crore  is the sum of Repayment of Long Term Borrowings pf Rs. 343.80 Crore, Repayment of Buyer's Credit/Supplier's Credit of Rs. 1128.60 Crore, Net Repayment from Short Term Borrowings of Rs. 2750.42 Crore and Net Proceeds of Line of Credit Facility of Rs. 60.53 Crore.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
